Chapter 10 – Dimension and Fact Tables
10.1 Overview
The Dimension and Fact tables form the business and analytical layer of the MHMR data processing solution in Microsoft Fabric.
After the source data is loaded and processed through the RAW, Staging, History, and Snapshot layers, business-specific transformation logic is applied to create the required Dimension and Fact tables.
The current implementation consists of:
- 15 Dimension Tables
- 3 Fact Tables
Each Dimension and Fact table has its own transformation logic based on the corresponding business requirements and existing SQL implementation.
The objective is to implement the existing SQL business logic in Microsoft Fabric while maintaining the required data structure and expected results for downstream reporting and analytics.
